      <tr><td><b>Common pleco</b><br><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)">"algae eater", 3" juvenile</span></td><td>Reaches <b>18–24 inches</b>, needs 125+ gallons, stops eating algae as an adult and produces enormous waste</td><td class="hi">Bristlenose pleco — stays 4–6"</td></tr>
