      <tr><td><b>Iridescent shark</b><br><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)">(pangasius catfish)</span></td><td>A genuine food fish — reaches <b>3–4 feet</b>. Sold at 3 inches</td><td class="hi">Nothing in this size class belongs in a home tank</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Red-tail / rainbow shark</b></td><td>6", and increasingly territorial with age — will bully bottom dwellers and other sharks in anything under 55 gallons</td><td class="hi">One only, in a 55 gal+ with caves</td></tr>
